  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.41455078125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "applicable regulatory framework; financing; the choice between an operational research setting or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4212646484375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "programmatic implementation; human resource issues (including staffing requirements and human",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3992919921875,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "resources development, such as capacity-building/training and consultation skills); monitoring and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.3947143554688,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "evaluation; qualitative research into community needs; perceptions (including views on stigma); and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.338623046875,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "suggestions. Decentralization of services to the PHC level requires that child and adolescent TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4443359375,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "services are integrated within general PHC services, resulting in possible significant overlap between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        347.9296875,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "decentralization and family-centred, integrated approaches.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        168.18463134765625,
        527.43212890625,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "Contact investigation : Active contact investigation at community and household level is a critical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        525.8867797851562,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "intervention for enhancing both case-finding and the provision of TPT to children and adolescents.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        203.0885009765625,
        527.3106079101562,
        217.64149475097656
      ],
      "text": "Task-shifting : Decentralization not only concerns the levels of the health system but should ideally also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.9473237991333,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.407958984375,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "take place within the same structure, by training all health-care providers of all child and adolescent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4398803710938,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "care services in the recognition and management of TB. This so-called task-shifting was mentioned",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        309.05682373046875,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "by the GDG as an important implementation factor.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        264.39263916015625,
        527.4011840820312,
        278.9456481933594
      ],
      "text": "Family-centred and integrated care : Although in child health, care evolves around the family, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.70257568359375,
        527.4309692382812,
        292.1455993652344
      ],
      "text": "concept of family-centred care has not been well defined. Family-centred care is related to the more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.6265869140625,
        527.4593505859375,
        305.3456115722656
      ],
      "text": "(121) common concept of patient-centred care. The End TB Strategy   states: “Patient-centred care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.10247802734375,
        527.151611328125,
        318.5455017089844
      ],
      "text": "involves systematically assessing and addressing the needs and expectations of patients. The objective",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969407081604004,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.302490234375,
        527.4298706054688,
        331.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "is to provide high-quality TB diagnosis and treatment to all patients – men, women and children –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.5025939941406,
        527.3643798828125,
        344.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "without their having to incur catastrophic costs. Depending on patients’ needs, educational, emotional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967101097106934,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.7025146484375,
        527.6015014648438,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "and economic support should be provided to enable them to complete the diagnostic process",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.9026184082031,
        527.1800537109375,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "and the full course of prescribed treatment.” Multiple descriptions exist that include components",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        527.3958740234375,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "of support and education based on individual needs, building a patient–provider partnership and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.3025207519531,
        527.4013061523438,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "participatory decision-making. Family-centred care also includes interventions at household level to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.5025939941406,
        527.4189453125,
        410.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "identify members of the household requiring evaluation for TB disease, TPT, treatment support and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.7025146484375,
        527.4542236328125,
        424.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "so on. As the concept of family-centred, integrated care may be specific to the setting, one of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.9026184082031,
        527.3936767578125,
        437.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "first steps in implementation includes clarifying which definition applies to the setting in which the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.10260009765625,
        527.443115234375,
        450.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "care is to be implemented. Similarly, the implementation strategy varies by setting and needs to be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.3025207519531,
        434.61199951171875,
        463.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "country- or region-specific and informed by social, cultural and societal values.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.0065002441406,
        527.3893432617188,
        485.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "The package of TB services to be provided should be defined and developed by the national TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.2065124511719,
        527.376220703125,
        498.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "programme in close coordination with other relevant programmes, such as through an existing child",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.406494140625,
        527.4505004882812,
        511.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "and adolescent TB technical working group. This package should seek to identify and address capacity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966097831726074,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.60650634765625,
        527.4639892578125,
        525.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "needs for national programmes interested in the uptake of proposed interventions, and should ideally",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973067283630371,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.8065185546875,
        527.1132202148438,
        538.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "be based on family and community perceptions of the ideal family-centred model of care. The package",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949434280395508,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.0064697265625,
        527.428955078125,
        551.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "could include community-based models for active contact investigation, identifying children with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.20654296875,
        527.4354858398438,
        564.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "signs and symptoms or exposure as part of routine growth-monitoring services, or an integrated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.406494140625,
        527.427978515625,
        577.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "model for IMCI integration, starting with the sick child and identifying signs and symptoms pointing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.6065063476562,
        190.81781005859375,
        591.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "to a high likelihood of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.3104248046875,
        527.6027221679688,
        612.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "Integration can start within the family by equipping family members with the knowledge to recognize",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98529052734375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.5103759765625,
        527.4057006835938,
        625.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "signs and symptoms in order to understand the importance of a history of contact, to know when",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.7103881835938,
        527.4542236328125,
        639.1533813476562
      ],
      "text": "to seek help at the health-care facility and how to minimize stigma related to TB. High-yield entry",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.9105224609375,
        527.37841796875,
        652.353515625
      ],
      "text": "points provide a good place to start within the health system. For instance, child and adolescent TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.1104125976562,
        527.1602783203125,
        665.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "services can be integrated with malnutrition clinics, ANC, the Expanded Programme on Immunization,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969657897949219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.3104248046875,
        527.4024047851562,
        678.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "inpatient sites, adult TB and chest clinics, HIV and general paediatric clinics. TB care should ideally be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.5103759765625,
        527.438720703125,
        691.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "integrated into general health services rather than being limited to enhanced coordination between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.7103881835938,
        527.4496459960938,
        705.1533813476562
      ],
      "text": "two programmes. However, defining an optimal patient flow between services and creating strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.9105224609375,
        527.3980712890625,
        718.353515625
      ],
      "text": "links between child health entry points and TB clinics remains essential, especially in facilities where",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.1104125976562,
        527.40380859375,
        731.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "services are physically separated. This is critical for enhancing the quality of services, including the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.3104248046875,
        527.3981323242188,
        744.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "follow-up of persons with TB during the diagnostic evaluation, and also for ensuring the accuracy of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.5103759765625,
        527.399169921875,
        757.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "recording and reporting. In the early phase, pilot programmes could be considered, and should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        756.7103881835938,
        324.6691589355469,
        771.1533813476562
      ],
      "text": "evaluated and adjusted as needed and then scaled up.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323.2414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 Tuberculosis care and support: Recommendations 197",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}